  triage:description "fenix critical design review, PR #1438 comment https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1438#issuecomment-5648340494 (2026-09-12T20:01:44Z), reviewed at b06b3e262. writer/task_ops.rs:412 returns Ok(row.assignee) on the no-op start (reminder not emitted / already Active), so the pre-BB.4 daemon receipt renders task_started without an actual state change. Consistent with design section 9 (\"Started for the daemon receipt until section 4.4 lands\"); note only, resolved by BB.4." ;
